    5000       176   0.09281   0.11729   0.02448
   50000       176   0.09287   0.11734   0.02448

  INTERPRETATION: if |corr| -> a LIMIT as M->inf governed by cross-block E_+ shrinking,
  then a bound |corr| <= f(cross-E_+) closes the multi-block case when cross-E_+ is low.

